  "title": "Q1-SP4 技术方案",
  "body": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"0a75363d-a290-4a6b-9dc5-e4c39c3ebfe6\" ac:macro-id=\"7f1d8bd6-2f0d-4354-9621-33361d3f5fe9\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"style\">none</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro><h1 local-id=\"2351ad0e-518d-45bd-908d-387dc2c0d330\">一、需求文档</h1><p local-id=\"d9ccf2743b7a\"><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"jira\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"1bc5154d1532\" ac:macro-id=\"cd3b6486-4036-4437-8688-89109f208854\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"key\">PAPI-2214</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"serverId\">de7aed67-63d8-3a91-aff7-ab8b7cec1d19</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"server\">System Jira</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro> </p><p local-id=\"179643fef1fd\"><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"jira\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"1a7a69bd2603\" ac:macro-id=\"c81f1313-06d4-44be-8cc2-db0bec83057b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"key\">PAPI-2352</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"serverId\">de7aed67-63d8-3a91-aff7-ab8b7cec1d19</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"server\">System Jira</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro> </p><h1 local-id=\"099834fa-2d24-4337-aaa3-52f9b80eea56\">二、技术方案</h1><h3 local-id=\"816ea014-297f-442d-bfd8-724305a92af3\">2.1 、会籍注册和权益查询接口的权益查询 为通用代码逻辑</h3><p local-id=\"5b733f5c3ac1\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(191,38,0);\">查询所有权益模板下面是否设置了等级权益，有则置空maxGuestsNextUse 和 allowedGuestsPerUsage 字段，没有则按旧逻辑计算</span></strong></p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"229\" ac:original-width=\"803\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"423a848e9ad3\" ac:alt=\"image-20260302-031359.png\" ac:width=\"760\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20260302-031359.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p local-id=\"032ac58b8df5\" /><h3 local-id=\"cd5c03ee-e705-42a3-947c-e26fa36dab9c\">2.1.1、 时序图</h3><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"2905\" ac:original-width=\"1234\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"e32101771cab\" ac:alt=\"queryEq-时序图-handlerExclusiveEntitlement-20260206-101645.png\" ac:width=\"760\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"queryEq-时序图-handlerExclusiveEntitlement-20260206-101645.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><h3 local-id=\"283d80ec6b80\">2.1.2、 整体流程图</h3><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"1249\" ac:original-width=\"1024\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"802a00869766\" ac:alt=\"queryEq-handlerExclusiveEntitlement_-20260206-055033.png\" ac:width=\"760\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"queryEq-handlerExclusiveEntitlement_-20260206-055033.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><h3 local-id=\"c0b2d9e0-ee60-4001-a770-b29ecb9bea55\"><strong>2.2、权益明细接口</strong></h3><p local-id=\"927562a6716d\">/v2/entitlements/update</p><h3 local-id=\"21922662a797\">2.2.1、 时序图</h3><p local-id=\"ecc27e384810\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(191,38,0);\">分级权益一句话概括：就是过滤出指定等级的权益，然后进行update</span></strong></p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"3204\" ac:original-width=\"669\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"a571c58db1d1\" ac:alt=\"entitlementsupdateV2-_v2_entitlements_update__-20260302-024652.png\" ac:width=\"669\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"entitlementsupdateV2-_v2_entitlements_update__-20260302-024652.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p local-id=\"211007164768\"><strong>整个接口时序图：</strong></p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"4746\" ac:original-width=\"1121\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"348086d98b95\" ac:alt=\"queryEqupdate-时序图-Tier-20260206-101035.png\" ac:width=\"760\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"queryEqupdate-时序图-Tier-20260206-101035.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p local-id=\"65dc9d96699a\" /><h3 local-id=\"9f718edf6ac6\">2.2.2、 整体业务图</h3><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"1683\" ac:original-width=\"1333\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"bc4b26c4888b\" ac:alt=\"queryEqupdate-Tier-20260206-093851.png\" ac:width=\"760\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"queryEqupdate-Tier-20260206-093851.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><h2 local-id=\"fe5fd3b6f520\">2.3 <strong>权益明细接口</strong></h2><h3 local-id=\"ae408da5fdfd\">2.3.1 时序图</h3><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"4096\" ac:original-width=\"1506\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"6298c38aad89\" ac:alt=\"entitlements-details-ds-_v2_entitlements_details__-20260302-075716.png\" ac:width=\"760\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"entitlements-details-ds-_v2_entitlements_details__-20260302-075716.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p local-id=\"b3816c96dfa1\" /><h2 local-id=\"deedccfac50b\">2.4 放开语种限制</h2><h3 local-id=\"a0c9b97aa65a\">2.4.1 全局拦截器时序图</h3><p local-id=\"a88dffa9cf13\" style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\">会在全局拦截器中去除权限语种的限制。</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"2229\" ac:original-width=\"734\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"68543fa958a7\" ac:alt=\"diagram-7580946029805101431-20260227-075745.png\" ac:width=\"734\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"diagram-7580946029805101431-20260227-075745.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><h3 local-id=\"74261e7c9dbe\">2.4.2 影响范围</h3><p local-id=\"050671a69b39\" style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\">在全局拦截器中修改，所以调个别场景回归即可。</p>"
}